Circos for Debian
-----------------

To test the installation of the package, go to a copy of the directory
/usr/share/doc/circos/example and execute:

 circos -conf circos.conf

The files ‘circos.svg’ and ‘circos.png’ will be regenerated, and can be
compared to the originals.

Warning: Many example files are compressed in /usr/share/doc/circos/examples/*.
Running the example program will failed due to the compressed files. To execute
 the sample program, you should first uncompress those files.

